{title: Oyate wama yanka po}

Oyate wama yanka po - call
Oyate wama yanka po - response
Oyate wama yanka po
Canupa wakan ca
Yuha cewaki yelo he
Oyate yanipit'kta cha
Leca mu welo hey
Oyate wama kanka po
Canupa waken ca
Yuha cewaki yelo hey
Oyate yanipi'kta ca
Leca mu welo hey

{ci: People look at me}
{ci: Here is a sacred pipe}
{ci: I am praying with it}
{ci: Our people will live}
{ci: That is why I do this}
